// Builds point at the live server, https://lanvi.app, but only talk to it once paired.
// The app never asks for a code: put a one-time code from Mathew here to pair silently.
// With no code (and no earlier pairing) the app quietly runs on offline sample data.
//
// Copy this file to Config.xcconfig (git-ignored) only to point the app at
// another server, for example a local engine, or to pair silently with a test code.
// Never commit a real code.
//
// In xcconfig files "//" starts a comment, so write the address with $()
// between the two slashes, like this: https:/$()/example.org
LANVI_SERVER_URL = https:/$()/lanvi.app
LANVI_PAIRING_CODE =
